DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Heute feiern wir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Tsukimi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Weißt du, was das ist?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich denke, man könnte es mit
eurer {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Nacht des Herbstmondes{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
vergleichen.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Wir schauen auf in den Nachthimmel
und bewundern die Schönheit und
das Leuchten des Mondes.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Stasera festeggiamo lo {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Tsukimi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sarà uno spettacolo formidable!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Qual è la prima cosa che ti viene
in mente se si parla di luna piena,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0008:0005:0600000007000000}}
I dolcetti di riso!
Il coniglio sulla luna!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}C'est vrai?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Dici sul serio?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Pensi
a un coniglio? Uno come me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Così mi imbarazzi...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Dur.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Gerçekten mi?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Neredeyse benden
bahsediyormuşsun gibi oldu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Eyvah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} şimdi yüzüm kızardı.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Doğru ya,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ay’da yaşayan bir tavşanla
ilgili hikâye okuduğumu hatırlıyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yemek için mochi yapıyormuş!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}The moon is very beautiful tonight,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but I must admit I find myself more
enchanted by the dango rice cakes.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}La lune me rend toujours nerveuse :{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
j'ai envie de courir dans tous les
sens en hurlant à la mort !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}La luna piena mi rende nervooosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non so pourquoi, ma mi fa venire
voglia di uuuluuulaaare!
